  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</a></span> has released the DV Document Upload for the Female Health Worker (ANM) Post. This recruitment was released for 5272 posts. The applications for UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment 2024 were accepted from October 28, 2024, to November 27, 2024. <span data-teams=\"true\">The written examination is scheduled to be conducted on January 11, 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) DV Document Upload 2026 from the link provided below.</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UPSSSC) </span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Female Health Worker DV Document Upload 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No. : 11-Exam/2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>14 October 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 October 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <b>27 November 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date of Fee Payment :<strong> 27 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>04 December 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>11 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>01 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>07 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>16 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>24 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">DV Document Upload : <strong>27 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC / ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH (Dviyang) : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Notification 2024 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>As on 01 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) 2024 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 5272 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 41.5188%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 41.5188%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Female Health Worker (ANM)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2399</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #00000