 redirected to the dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download it from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" dat